{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>石硤尾邨美山樓。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>石硤尾邨發生糾紛案。 今日（21日）清晨6時28分，石硤尾邨美山樓一名42歲姓蔡女子與38歲姓張丈夫因感情問題爭執，其間丈夫情緒激動，她擔心對方會傷害自己，於是報警。警方到場後，發現兩人平靜，沒有人受傷，經調查後將案列作「糾紛」處理。據了解，女子因丈夫有外遇發生爭執，惟二人拒絕轉介社工跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T03:20:17.783005+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:25:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:58.934799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T03:17:44.231653+00:00","content_hash":"62bcd5a49ffe5cd92d8c7f122801c1c2067f8bf80ec5b3955d52c2c5306ca092","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}